Sun Nov  8 05:00:00 UTC 2026 - caiocco <caiocco@yahoo.com.br>

- Initial package of PeaZip 11.4.0 for openSUSE Leap 16.0
  * Build against Lazarus 3.6 from openSUSE:Backports:SLE-16.0
  * Ship two mutually exclusive packages, peazip-gtk (GTK 2)
    and peazip-qt (Qt 6), as upstream does
  * Installed (non portable) layout like the upstream RPM:
    binaries in %{_libdir}/peazip, resources in /usr/share/peazip
  * Use the system 7z, zstd and brotli instead of bundled binaries
  * Drop the Windows and macOS only resources
  * Mark only the sample scripts with a shebang executable
